sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant KeyboardListener
    participant InputSystem
    participant GameLoop
    participant Tetromino
    participant Cell
    participant VisualPosition

    User->>KeyboardListener: Press softdrop key (e.g., down arrow)
    KeyboardListener->>InputSystem: Detect key press
    InputSystem->>GameLoop: Enable softdrop mode (faster drop speed)

    loop Game Loop (each frame)
        GameLoop->>Tetromino: Update position (drop faster due to softdrop)
        Tetromino->>Cell: Move cell to new logical position
        Cell->>VisualPosition: Set destination to new position
        GameLoop->>VisualPosition: Update animation (deltaTime)
        VisualPosition->>VisualPosition: Accelerate and move srcX/srcY towards destX/destY
    end

    Note over VisualPosition: Animation continues until src reaches dest
